    "Mixed-currency batch totals refuse atomically; individual agents can settle their own currencies",
    "Fixed facade nonexistent delegate names and nullable-model/list mismatch; no new route or operator permission",
    "Original journal account reads now current under an owned transaction",
    "Member unpaid cancellation also checks durable payout receipts even if mutable paid fields, references and ledger labels were erased"
  ],
